  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Chose a hotkey of your choise and bind it to this macro. To use this macro succesfully, I recocmend to bind "scroll wheel up" to "move forward" and scroll "wheel down" to "jump" in the Apex settings. Then, run, jump and hold crouch the entire time. whilst doing that, make sure to spam "scroll wheel up" and "scroll wheel down". Scroll wheel up to tap strafe in the directions of the macro and scroll wheel down to bunny hop. Practice in "shooting range" first.
Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
